<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Chandigarh to Bangalore | Safe Two-Wheeler Shipping
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does it typically take to transport a bike from Chandigarh to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The standard transit time is 5‑7 business days, depending on traffic conditions and weather along the NH 44 and NH 33 corridor. Our dedicated hydraulic ramp trailers and live GPS tracking ensure the bike moves efficiently, while our 24‑hour support keeps you updated throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What packaging methods are used to protect my bike during the Chandigarh‑to‑Bangalore move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ a 7‑layer foam wrapping system that includes heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard sheets, weather‑proof stretch film, and custom wooden crates for delicate parts. This multi‑layer approach, combined with secure ratchet lashings, guarantees zero scratches.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is full insurance coverage included for bike transport from Chandigarh to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every shipment is covered by 100 % declared‑value IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance at no extra cost. The policy protects against loss, theft, and damage, and our IBA‑approved documentation streamlines any claim you may need to file.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time while it travels from Chandigarh to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Each container is equipped with a satellite‑enabled GPS unit that provides live location updates via our customer portal or mobile app. You receive instant alerts at key milestones, ensuring complete visibility from doorstep pickup to final delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for a smooth bike relocation between Chandigarh and Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid government‑issued ID, bike registration certificate, GSTIN (if applicable), and an e‑Way bill for interstate transport. Our team also prepares the IBA‑approved mover code paperwork, making the process hassle‑free for both personal and corporate moves.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you offer door‑to‑door service for bike transport from Chandigarh to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, our end‑to‑end service includes doorstep pickup at your Chandigarh location, secure loading onto our hydraulic ramp trailers, and final doorstep delivery in Bangalore. Our trained crew handles every step, so you don’t need to worry about logistics.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure zero‑scratch delivery for my two‑wheeler?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our zero‑scratch guarantee is backed by the hydraulic ramp loading system that eliminates manual lifting, the 7‑layer foam wrapping for shock absorption, and sealed container transport that protects against road debris. Combined with our experienced crew, this ensures your bike arrives pristine.</p>
      </div>
